WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
A humanoid approaches a gray box suspended from overhead straps, above a wooden platform with a marked rectangular target.

00:08.000 --> 00:18.000
The robot contacts the box with both hands and guides its position while the suspended box descends toward the platform.

00:18.000 --> 00:26.000
The robot makes final adjustments and stops as the payload settles onto the platform, near the marked target.
